<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Sawako Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Sawako Corp cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd downgraded Sawako Corporation to a &quot;2&quot; rating from its previous &quot;1&quot;, Nikko brokers said on Friday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;2&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the key 225-share Nikkei average over the next six months.</p>
</text>
